 and sensor devices within a building; and Third-Party Integration, which allows third-party hardware manufacturers to embed Latch technology in their products. It serves real estate developers, builders, building owners and property managers. Latch, Inc. is headquartered in Olivette, Missouri.", "fullTimeEmployees": 120, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. David  Lillis", "age": 50, "title": "CEO & Principal Executive Officer", "yearBorn": 1975, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 976340, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jeff  Mayfield", "age": 48, "title": "CFO & Principal Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 609206, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Priyen  Patel", "age": 38, "title": "Chief Strategy & Legal Officer", "yearBorn": 1987, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 806420, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. James W. Siminoff", "age": 47, "title": "Advisor", "yearBorn": 1978, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ryan  Salmons", "age": 35, "title": "Chief Product & Technology Officer", "yearBorn": 1990, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Cierra  Olson", "title": "VP of People Operations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "executiveTeam": [], "maxAge": 86400, "priceHint": 4, "previousClose": 0.167, "open": 0.18, "dayLow": 0.1507, "dayHigh": 0.1892, "regularMarketPreviousClose": 0.167, "regularMarketOpen": 0.18, "regularMarketDayLow": 0.1507, "regularMarketDayHigh": 0.1892, "payoutRatio": 0.0, "beta": 1.289, "forwardPE": -0.20454547, "volume": 46368, "regularMarketVolume": 46368, "averageVolume": 35875, "averageVolume10days": 47770, "averageDailyVolume10Day": 47770, "bid": 0.18, "ask": 0.1892, "bidSize": 5000, "askSize": 5898, "marketC